{"version":1,"content":"<p>澳洲無黨籍國會議員海恩斯（Helen Haines）周一（19日）遭男子駕車撞至斷腿，目前情況危殆但穩定。</p><p>43歲男疑犯紐金特（Brendan Nugent）周三（21日）在維多利亞省旺加拉塔（Wangaratta）法院提堂，被控危險駕駛導致他人嚴重受傷、蓄意造成他人嚴重受傷、傷害公職人員，另涉種植及管有大麻兩罪。</p><p>他未有申請保釋，案件押後至明年2月4日再訊。</p><p>（路透社/法新社）</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T05:59:50.304952+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":191,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T04:45:23+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T21:57:40.581707+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T05:57:39.366530+00:00","content_hash":"3cdd1e9b2b62c0ce24fbd05abe2a9a3fb853d64760a0d32cf7d28a9c3466bcf7","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}